{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2","id":945788,"title":"What do you want to see in Dark Eras 2?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-07T18:28:03-07:00","id":945788,"title":"What do you want to see in Dark Eras 2?","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rose Bailey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/944937-dark-eras-panel?p=945334#post945334\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh, we are <i>soo </i>doing DarkEras II.<br /> <br /> Kickstarter in 2017, book in 2018 or late 2017.</div> </div> </div> </div>So with a second Dark Eras book officially confirmed for two years from now, I figured I'd do the only sensible thing and make a thread for it. Is there anything in particular you're clamoring for, whether specific eras or more general ideas? Are there crossover settings you want to see? What historical settings have you dreamed up on your own that you'd like to see done?<br /> <br /> I'll toss my own ideas out further downthread, but let's have an awesome discussion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T18:51:21-07:00","id":945801,"title":"","content":"Having seen what we've gotten so far I think, personally, that the eras do best when they're at a differing or defining point for the supernatural they're focusing on to act as a linchpin for the era.<br /> <br /> With that in mind, without a specific era yet, I'd like to see the first of the Brethren Wars, for Werewolf. Also detailing of the Auytthaya Kingdom, mentioned in the Pack. It was supposed to be a place of great difference, but a specific time period could focus on their conquest and expansion or the Burmese Wars and their eventual fall. In addition the colonization of Australia, which according to the core book brought the Pure and Forsaken tribes into contact with the previously independent Dreaming Lodge <br /> <br /> As always, I like Golden Age of Piracy and Vietnam War Werewolf and expansion into the New World Vampire, preferably with a focus on South and Central America.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 08-07-2016, 09:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T18:56:33-07:00","id":945808,"title":"","content":"Fragmentation of Poland 1138-1314, Partitioned Poland, Dymitriads, or Second War Poland. Mage, Hunter and Werewolf sound most interesting for that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T19:08:27-07:00","id":945814,"title":"","content":"1) Ancient Sumer: Werewolf/Hunter.<br /> The Sumer chaper of Forsaken Chronicler's Guide was TOO SHORT. That setting has a great potential for werewolf, so I'd love to see it expanded. And in 2nd Edition, given the Sundering was about 2000 years before Sumer, the chapter could be the origin of the Werewolf Tribes.<br /> And for Hunters, it could be a great opportunity to see the Nibiru, the first Hunter conspirancy of known history.<br /> <br /> 2) Roman Empire: Vampire/Mage.<br /> For vampire, it could be an updating of Requiem for Rome to 2nd Edition.<br /> For Mage, it's the last one of the big three without a roman setting, and given than the origin of the darshanas it's been just a few centuries ago, it could be the moment in which the darshanas became orders, at least in the western world.<br /> <br /> 3) Spanish Civil War: Geist. It was the prelude of the WWII, and the first time there were massive plane bombings over civilian objectives in cities. Also, the repression (in both sides of the conflict, although specially in the Franco's side) during and after was enormous, causing hundreds of thousands of fatalities. Spain has over 200.000 corpses unidentified in mass graves of the postwar repression. So I think the death themes and mood are perfect for Geist.<br /> <br /> 4) Mummy: I've got two options.<br /> a) Akhenaton Egypt: As an historian I'm really fascinated by Akhenaton reign, so I'd love to know more about him in the CoD. But I understand that there's been too Egyptian themed Eras for Mummy (3 from Sothis Ascends, and 2 from Dark Eras and Companion).<br /> b) Andine Mummies. How Iremite mummies arrived to the Andes (eve before the Incan Empire) and created there their own cults. But please, don't write than mummies are the creators of the andine cultures or the teachers of their most advanced knowledge.<br /> <br /> 5) Ancient India: Whatever line!!!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>LAND OF THE DAMNED: SPAIN (Spanish): </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/3MHWYm\" target=\"_blank\">Land of the Damned: Spain</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/52b0TX\" target=\"_blank\">Kingdoms of Blood: Spain</a>; Cities of the Damned: <a href=\"https://goo.gl/XFMSSe\" target=\"_blank\">Barcelona</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/AXxdgq\" target=\"_blank\">Valencia</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/zkI5a1\" target=\"_blank\">Carthian Constitution</a> (1812), <a href=\"https://goo.gl/5H8M4s\" target=\"_blank\">Three Arrows Pact</a>: <br /> <br /> <b>OTHERS (Spanish): </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/36HngB\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: The Redemption</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/6B9V8l\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Forgotten</a>","edited":{"userid":247,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/247-uxas","user":"Uxas","date":". 08-07-2016, 10:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/247-uxas","name":"Uxas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar247_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T19:12:32-07:00","id":945819,"title":"","content":"I'd scribbled together something for a Seven Years' War setting in Vampire, specifically focused around the areas that would become Canada and acting as a prologue to the Montreal setting in the 2e corebook. It painted the Invictus and Lance as respectively backing the British mercantile interests and French Catholics, explored some of the weirdness surrounding the Native vampires and their interactions with the Strix, had a lost Wendigo clan/bloodline, and was supposed to offer hints towards the identity of the Nameless. It might be fun to toss Hunter onto the pile in order to show what the Acheron Trade Company (the precursor to the Cheiron Group) was like, along with a weaker Malleus Maleficarum and perhaps an Iroquois Conspiracy as well.<br /> <br /> Though currently stalled, my <i>All Along The Watchtowers </i>is a 1960s American setting for Mage, though again it could work well with some Hunter thrown in (especially to incorporate some of the <i>Witch Finders</i> groups) focused on the symbolic upheaval of the time and the painful awakening of the country following the Vietnam War and so much racial conflict. I wanted to let the conflict between the Pentacle and Iron Pyramid to take center stage and heat up, as well as provide a 'sequel' to Mage Noir.<br /> <br /> This one's a lot less thought out, but an Ancient Greek setting that lets Beasts act more openly as fantastic monsters and agents of divine will (like the Furies), also acting as a Changeling or possibly even Deviant crossover era where the focus is more on being cursed (like Medusa or Arachne) by the gods. I'd like to see the Changeling/Deviants victims of possibly undue or overwhelming punishment butt heads with the sacred monsters, along with having an excuse to rampage around as Scylla or the Hydra. (Someone else had proposed a Bronze Age Collapse setting for Beast, which I love but know nothing about).<br /> <br /> Other than that, more crossover settings, more settings throughout Asia (I'd pay for a Victorian Hong Kong, 1930s Shanghai, or Russian Civil War <i>anything</i>) and South America (I need that Andrean Mummy idea), try to do Rome for another game or two to complete the set, and more lost or historical splats like old Clans/Bloodlines/Lodges/Legacies/etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":281,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","user":"atamajakki","date":". 08-07-2016, 10:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T19:33:38-07:00","id":945833,"title":"","content":"Actually, after thinking about it, I think that Partitioned Poland Demon/Mage crossover could be really neat. Lots of material for themes about maintaining your identity and fighting against processes that try to erase it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Partitions_of_Poland#Aftermath\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/Polish-Lithuanian_Commonwealth_in_1772.PNG/1280px-Polish-Lithuanian_Commonwealth_in_1772.PNG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Partitions_of_Poland#Aftermath\" target=\"_blank\"> Partitions of Poland - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Partitions_of_Poland#Aftermath\" target=\"_blank\"> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Partitions_of_Poland#Aftermath </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T19:34:06-07:00","id":945834,"title":"","content":"Hey, I had an entire thread of this before it was official <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I'd like to see less American and European history and more of South American, Sub-Saharan Africa and the Middle East. Just to get a bit more balance with parts of the world that are represented. If we could get Vampire in the Ancient Far East or the Americas (read:somewhere with no ties to Rome), that would be awesome. Prometheans in Australia before colonization. Beast in the Zanzibar Sultanate. Wild West Geist. Blitz Innocents. Book of Judges Hunter. The Fall of the Esfahan Freehold. Mummy/Mage French Revolution. Cuban Revolution Demon. Oath of the Moon Werewolf in India.<br /> <br /> Also, remember Russian Revolution Demon is in the Companion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":4433,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","user":"Second Chances","date":". 08-07-2016, 10:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T19:39:11-07:00","id":945836,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=945834#post945834\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey, I had an entire thread of this before it was official <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I'd like to see less American and European history and more of South American, Sub-Saharan Africa and the Middle East. Just to get a bit more balance with parts of the world that are represented. If we could get Vampire in the Ancient Far East or the Americas (read:somewhere with no ties to Rome), that would be awesome. Prometheans in Australia before colonization. Beast in the Zanzibar Sultanate. Wild West Geist. Blitz Innocents. Book of Judges Hunter. The Fall of the Esfahan Freehold. Mummy/Mage French Revolution. Cuban Revolution Demon.<br /> <br /> Also, remember Russian Revolution Demon is in the Companion.</div> </div> </div> </div>I wish I knew enough about Middle Eastern history to have pitches for it. A Chinese Vampire setting that gives us wholly new covenants woukd be an absolute blast.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T19:50:55-07:00","id":945848,"title":"","content":"More Sundered World. I cannot have enough Sundered World. I second Bronze Age Collapse for Beast and maybe Deviant, and I would propose Arthurian Britain for Changeling/Mage. Or The Book of Invasions Ireland for Beast/Changeling.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T20:15:27-07:00","id":945862,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=945836#post945836\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I wish I knew enough about Middle Eastern history to have pitches for it. A Chinese Vampire setting that gives us wholly new covenants woukd be an absolute blast.</div> </div> </div> </div>God, I feel like we could do an entire book of Dark Eras on the Mongol Empire and the Kingdoms that came out of it after it broke apart.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T20:19:53-07:00","id":945871,"title":"","content":"How about Vampire in the age of Napoleon, including the French Revolution and the reign of Napoleon itself. For vampire it would show the earliest nights of the Carthian Movement.<br /> <br /> I think Changeling and Beast during the Golden age of animation OR the period between 1950 and 1966 when Disney was expanding into the TV and theme park business would be an interesting way at looking at how uncle Walt distorted the traditional folktales. Never mind what Walt was up to with his plans for EPCOT.<br /> <br /> And of course, Beast in the 90s, which to me is a extension of themes New Wave Requiem did with the idea of the 80s putting on a poppy happy face to cover up their fear and anger. The 90s would be the decade where that happy face is starting to crack and the fear is showing just a bit, creating a feeding frenzy for the begotten.<br /> <br /> Speaking of New Wave Requiem I want to make the 80s a setting for every splat along with sundered world.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":3932,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","user":"The young man in the cafe","date":". 08-07-2016, 11:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T20:53:46-07:00","id":945907,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arcanist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=945848#post945848\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">More Sundered World. I cannot have enough Sundered World. I second Bronze Age Collapse for Beast and maybe Deviant, and I would propose Arthurian Britain for Changeling/Mage. Or The Book of Invasions Ireland for Beast/Changeling.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd also love that for vampire: different settings that offers us different cultural covenants (Islam, Ancient China, India...).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>LAND OF THE DAMNED: SPAIN (Spanish): </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/3MHWYm\" target=\"_blank\">Land of the Damned: Spain</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/52b0TX\" target=\"_blank\">Kingdoms of Blood: Spain</a>; Cities of the Damned: <a href=\"https://goo.gl/XFMSSe\" target=\"_blank\">Barcelona</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/AXxdgq\" target=\"_blank\">Valencia</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/zkI5a1\" target=\"_blank\">Carthian Constitution</a> (1812), <a href=\"https://goo.gl/5H8M4s\" target=\"_blank\">Three Arrows Pact</a>: <br /> <br /> <b>OTHERS (Spanish): </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/36HngB\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: The Redemption</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/6B9V8l\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Forgotten</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/247-uxas","name":"Uxas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar247_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T21:07:38-07:00","id":945920,"title":"","content":"Beast Pre-Colonial Australia could be pretty cool. Not only because it's a land where everything can kill you (lots of inspiration for potential horrors), but also because it's a land where you can beasts and geotia drifting along the Songlines. It's a time and place where the lessons a beast is meant to teach isn't outdated, it's the true time when a beast's lessons actually could be the difference between life and death. You can tap into Dreamtime not because it's called Dreamtime, but because it is an immaterial place that is made of thought and story and warning. Also, you can have it interact with the ghost-wolves discussed in WtF 2e, where the beasts gained nightmares from the ghost-wolves, and the ghost-wolves learned how to communicate through dreams from interacting with beasts (resulting in the formulation of the Dream Lodge).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T22:15:31-07:00","id":945954,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=945920#post945920\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Beast Pre-Colonial Australia could be pretty cool. Not only because it's a land where everything can kill you (lots of inspiration for potential horrors), but also because it's a land where you can beasts and geotia drifting along the Songlines. It's a time and place where the lessons a beast is meant to teach isn't outdated, it's the true time when a beast's lessons actually could be the difference between life and death. You can tap into Dreamtime not because it's called Dreamtime, but because it is an immaterial place that is made of thought and story and warning. Also, you can have it interact with the ghost-wolves discussed in WtF 2e, where the beasts gained nightmares from the ghost-wolves, and the ghost-wolves learned how to communicate through dreams from interacting with beasts (resulting in the formulation of the Dream Lodge).</div> </div> </div> </div>I've had similar thoughts myself; there's certainly some <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GXikpns1bog\" target=\"_blank\">obvious inspiration</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/627-mr-innes","name":"Mr Innes","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T00:52:58-07:00","id":946004,"title":"","content":"Just some random idea throwing:<br /> Changeling in 1600's Poland would be very much awesome.<br /> Demon in pre-WWI Russia would also be.<br /> Pre-Colonial Australia Beast/Changeling and Prison Colony Australia Werewolf are also very good ideas and I'll support them.<br /> Colonial India/China Hunter would be pretty nice too.<br /> I do want my Book of Judges Hunter, goddamit. Same goes for Innocents London.<br /> 1950's Deviant? Maybe? In Companion II?<br /> Vampire in 600's Arabia (The rise of Islam) seems pretty fun, doesn't it?<br /> Another cool Vampire era might be the Incan Empire.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11117,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11117-inquisitor","user":"Inquisitor","date":". 08-08-2016, 03:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11117-inquisitor","name":"Inquisitor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11117_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"138"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T02:03:45-07:00","id":946024,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=945920#post945920\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Beast Pre-Colonial Australia could be pretty cool. Not only because it's a land where everything can kill you (lots of inspiration for potential horrors), but also because it's a land where you can beasts and geotia drifting along the Songlines. It's a time and place where the lessons a beast is meant to teach isn't outdated, it's the true time when a beast's lessons actually could be the difference between life and death. You can tap into Dreamtime not because it's called Dreamtime, but because it is an immaterial place that is made of thought and story and warning. Also, you can have it interact with the ghost-wolves discussed in WtF 2e, where the beasts gained nightmares from the ghost-wolves, and the ghost-wolves learned how to communicate through dreams from interacting with beasts (resulting in the formulation of the Dream Lodge).</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you milo. This is an amazing post that encapsulates everything I would like to write for a DE2 in a succinct, beautiful format. <br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T02:06:47-07:00","id":946025,"title":"","content":"While new-new Dark Eras would be awesome, I would like first to see the Dark Eras we didn't got for the previous book. The ones I would really like to see are:<br /> <br /> Vampire- Jazz Age Requiem, Serpent and the Rainbow, Qin Dynasty<br /> Werewolf- pre-colonial Australia (with Beast), Ancient Sumer, Meiji Restoration<br /> Mage- French Revolution (with Mummy), Scramble For Africa, Tu'i Tonga Empire<br /> Promethean- Babylonian Captivity, Wars of Scottish Independence, San Francisco Earthquake<br /> Changeling- Parthian Empire, Catherinian Age, Danish Realm during H.C Andersen<br /> Hunter- Book of Judges, Spanish Inquisition, Punic Wars (with Demons)<br /> Geist- Golden Age of Piracy, Wild West, Irish Potato Famine<br /> Mummy- French Revolution (with Mage), Inca Empire, Age of Discovery<br /> Demon- Punic Wars (with Hunter), American Revolution, Sassanian Empire<br /> Beast- Ivan the Terrible, pre colonial Australia (with Werewolf), Mongol Empire<br /> Deviant- Rise of Modern Medicine, pre Christian Ireland, Hittite Bronze Age Collapse<br /> CofD- Italian Renaissance (Inferno), London Blitz (Innocents), Tang Dynasty (Immortals), WWII (general), Rome (crossover)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":503,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","user":"LostLight","date":". 08-08-2016, 11:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T05:21:38-07:00","id":946086,"title":"","content":"My issue with Werewolf in Pre-Colonial Australia is that WtF 2e said they are very very very very very low in population and didn't really form packs with other werewolves. Which seems like it would be annoyingly limiting for players.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T05:27:40-07:00","id":946087,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=946024#post946024\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Thank you milo. This is an amazing post that encapsulates everything I would like to write for a DE2 in a succinct, beautiful format.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>You're very welcome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T05:40:36-07:00","id":946095,"title":"","content":"It's a bit more contemporary than most eras and would require great care but post 9/11 (2001-2008) Demon.<br /> <br /> A time of endless paranoia and massive expansion of surveillance and infrastructure with America's longest war running in the background.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9065-darkblade","name":"Darkblade","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T06:17:23-07:00","id":946114,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arcanist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=945848#post945848\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">and I would propose Arthurian Britain for Changeling/Mage..</div> </div> </div> </div>This.<br /> Oh god.<br /> This!<br /> <br /> The Anglo-Saxon invasion, and the Arthurian Myths.<br /> They have both been brought up as important parts of local Changeling and Mage history. So of course we need to explore it some day!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/585-seidmadr","name":"Seidmadr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar585_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T07:20:16-07:00","id":946142,"title":"","content":"Any new era for Beast will be very welcome, but McCarthyism US would work really well for themes of fear.<br /> <br /> And as others have suggested, anything with the Mongol Empire. Maybe Werewolf for that one, but really there's room for a lot.<br /> <br /> And finally, WWI Promethean, because the 2nd edition book already hints at a unique lineage which came out of it <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10272-daigotsu-max","name":"Daigotsu Max","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T07:40:13-07:00","id":946159,"title":"","content":"Quite a few of the failed proposals for the first book are things I'd really like to see, pretty much nothing I wanted won the votes in the later polls. Although I guess I shouldn't complain, I think I saw someone say that not a single vote went their way, now that's pretty bad. <br /> <br /> As for new stuff, Beast- The Great White North, Beast the McCarthy Witch Hunts.<br /> <br /> Deviant- The Sixties- Drop in, and then drop out of the human race.... <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T08:24:01-07:00","id":946181,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=946025#post946025\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While new-new Dark Eras would be awesome, I would like first to see the Dark Eras we didn't got for the previous book. The ones I would really like to see are:<br /> <br /> Vampire- Jazz Age Requiem, Serpent and the Rainbow, Qin Dynasty<br /> Werewolf- pre-colonial Australia (with Beast), Ancient Sumer, Meiji Restoration<br /> Mage- French Revolution (with Mummy), Scramble For Africa, Tu'i Tonga Empire<br /> Promethean- Babylonian Captivity, Wars of Scottish Independence, San Francisco Earthquake<br /> Changeling- Parthian Empire, Catherinian Age, Danish Realm during H.C Andersen<br /> Hunter- Book of Judges, Spanish Inquisition, Punic Wars (with Demons)<br /> Geist- Golden Age of Piracy, Wild West, Irish Potato Famine<br /> Mummy- French Revolution (with Mage), Inca Empire, Age of Discovery<br /> Demon- Punic Wars (with Hunter), American Revolution, Sassanian Empire<br /> Beast- Ivan the Terrible, pre colonial Australia (with Werewolf), Mongol Empire<br /> Deviant- Rise of Modern Medicine, pre Christian Ireland, Hittite Bronze Age Collapse<br /> CofD- Italian Renaissance (Inferno), London Blitz (Innocents), Tang Dynasty (Immortals), WWII (general), Rome (crossover)</div> </div> </div> </div>I can't believe I forgot Meiji Werewolf...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T10:36:57-07:00","id":946273,"title":"","content":"American Civil War Changeling (possibly with tie-ins to Beast Reconstruction) and Demon American Revolution are the hills I'm going to die on!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T10:54:12-07:00","id":946283,"title":"","content":"Man, Mage/Mummy French Revolution, Book of Judges Hunter, and Jazz Age Vampire were all Eras I was really bummed didn't cut it","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T13:45:25-07:00","id":946424,"title":"","content":"I'm definitely going to use as submission material, either Qin Dynasty Vampire, Mage/Beast French Revolution, dante's Italy Geist (+ Inferno), Underground Railroad Changeling, or Birth of the Haudenosaunee Hunter....<br /> <br /> I'll write up a few along the submission guidelines and submit whichever one comes out best.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T13:46:38-07:00","id":946425,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZealousChristian24</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=946273#post946273\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">American Civil War Changeling (possibly with tie-ins to Beast Reconstruction) and Demon American Revolution are the hills I'm going to die on!</div> </div> </div> </div>Rather than the war, I'd go 10 years earlier with Changeling and focus on the Underground Railroad and the rising tension over slavery.<br /> <br /> With enough space, tie in Dahomey and Brazil via the dangerous Trods that Changeling conductors use","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T14:11:20-07:00","id":946444,"title":"","content":"A question, since I've seen it pop up a few times and I am curious - what is it about the notion of Meiji Restoration Werewolf that people find inspiring or intriguing as a potential Dark Eras setting?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T14:14:21-07:00","id":946446,"title":"","content":"These are the Eras that didn't make it:<ul><li>Vampire: Jazz Age Requiem</li> <li>Vampire: The Orient Express</li> <li>Vampire: The 1893 Chicago World's Fair</li> <li>Mage: French Revolution</li> <li>Hunter: 1830s India</li> <li>Hunter: WWII in the Pacific</li> <li>Hunter: The Spanish Inquisition</li> <li>Hunter: The Book of Judges</li> <li>Innocents: The Blitz</li> <li>Any: American Revolutionary War</li> <li>Geist: The Golden Age of Piracy</li> <li>Geist: Wild West</li> <li>Geist: 1970s-1980s Haiti</li> </ul>I really would like to see some of those making a comeback, like French Revolution, Blitz, Wild West and Golden Age of Piracy. The Spanish Inquisition would be awesome to tie with the Aztec setting and I the American Revolution might make for a good Hunter game. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/196-max-deltree","name":"Max Deltree","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar196_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T14:50:10-07:00","id":946477,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Acrozatarim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=946444#post946444\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A question, since I've seen it pop up a few times and I am curious - what is it about the notion of Meiji Restoration Werewolf that people find inspiring or intriguing as a potential Dark Eras setting?</div> </div> </div> </div>I can't speak for everyone- but for me, it is how Japan transforms during that time. The Emperor returns once more to be the one to hold the power, modernizing the nation and abolish old traditions. The Samurai class falls from grace, the Onmyodo lose its influence. Former hierarchies are destroyed while Japan tries to keep up with the rest of the world. European ideas clash with traditional values. All of that effects Hisil quit dramatically- like in the world of Flesh, the hierarchies of the Shadow are shattered, the Kami getting out of control. New spirits threat to take the place of old ones, gods fall asleep never to wake up again. Pacts and agreements between the Flesh and Spirit become null and void, and now the Uratha has to work to establish their presence in the new hierarchy.<br /> <br /> Plus, the Japanese Wolf is getting extinct during that time, which must mean something for the Uratha :P<br /> <br /> (symbolically speaking, not something like Apocalypse)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T14:57:24-07:00","id":946484,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Max Deltree</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=946446#post946446\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">These are the Eras that didn't make it:<br /> snipt</div> </div> </div> </div>you forgot the Scottish Wars of Independence as &quot;Any&quot; Era","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T15:00:09-07:00","id":946488,"title":"","content":"I want to see the War of Currents for Deviants, and I'm not saying that because I want to play a game where the PCs kill Edison. <br /> <br /> ...<br /> <br /> I'm not saying <i>just</i> that because I want to play a game where the party kills Edison.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T15:01:46-07:00","id":946491,"title":"","content":"Innocents: The Blitz","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T15:03:07-07:00","id":946494,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Acrozatarim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=946444#post946444\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A question, since I've seen it pop up a few times and I am curious - what is it about the notion of Meiji Restoration Werewolf that people find inspiring or intriguing as a potential Dark Eras setting?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it's the idea of the simultaneous extinguishing of the samurai tradition and the death of Japan's last wolves.<br /> <br /> Very few pitches though address WtF canon that the Uratha of Japan are exclusively Ainu (or those with Ainu descent), which would majorly shift the setting's focus.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T15:05:54-07:00","id":946496,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tiresias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=946488#post946488\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I want to see the War of Currents for Deviants, and I'm not saying that because I want to play a game where the PCs kill Edison. <br /> <br /> ...<br /> <br /> I'm not saying <i>just</i> that because I want to play a game where the party kills Edison.</div> </div> </div> </div>Roughly contemporaneous to that, I was thinking that Deviant could be wrapped into a big crossover setting for the 1893 World's Fair, playing on the eugenics era with vampiric intrigue in the White City, and Mages building toward the imminent Great Refusal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T15:07:08-07:00","id":946497,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=946496#post946496\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Roughly contemporaneous to that, I was thinking that Deviant could be wrapped into a big crossover setting for the 1893 World's Fair, playing on the eugenics era with vampiric intrigue in the White City, and Mages building toward the imminent Great Refusal.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ooooh, I would love this (and to write for it)!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T15:13:22-07:00","id":946499,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Acrozatarim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=946444#post946444\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A question, since I've seen it pop up a few times and I am curious - what is it about the notion of Meiji Restoration Werewolf that people find inspiring or intriguing as a potential Dark Eras setting?</div> </div> </div> </div>It could be Meiji Restoration anything, to be fair.<br /> <br /> And namely because that period started off such a radical cultural shift that, from what I've gathered, still reverberates consequences out even into today's modern Japanese culture. It was an utterly transformative time period, and what's more is that the forces at work in it make both familiar and very different from similar events in Western history.<br /> <br /> Also, if you need a hint as to the cool factor, for me at least, I'm off to go see Ruroni Kenshin: Origins. What can I say, I can come up with deep intellectual fascinations, or I can cop to being inspired by anime. Hell, I can do both.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T15:16:31-07:00","id":946500,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tiresias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=946488#post946488\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I want to see the War of Currents for Deviants, and I'm not saying that because I want to play a game where the PCs kill Edison.<br /> <br /> ...<br /> <br /> I'm not saying <i>just</i> that because I want to play a game where the party kills Edison.</div> </div> </div> </div>You make it sound like something you need to have a Dark Era for. Matter of fact, you make it sound like something you have to even be in the appropriate time period for.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11117-inquisitor","name":"Inquisitor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11117_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"138"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T15:41:01-07:00","id":946521,"title":"","content":"The Antarctic expeditions of the early 1900s are something worth bringing up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T16:07:46-07:00","id":946530,"title":"","content":"Reminder that French Revolution was Mage/Mummy. God do I want to see that!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T16:12:46-07:00","id":946534,"title":"","content":"My idle suggestion would be Grunge Geist, in early 90s Seattle, maybe touching on what's happening with Demon's splinter realities, especially pre-Y2K.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T16:19:59-07:00","id":946538,"title":"","content":"Watching <b>Stranger Things</b> has me on an 80's kick, so an 80's Innocents Era wold be a great interest. I would also love any World War I or World War II material for any of the splats.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1420009-the-artificer-s-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">The Artificer's Workshop</a> - A collection of Exalted Artifacts<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806809-curios-relics-and-tomes\" target=\"_blank\">Curios, Relics, and Tomes</a> - A collection of Relics (Cursed and Otherwise)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/793173-the-horror-show\" target=\"_blank\">The Horror Lab</a> - A collection of Beasts, Monsters and less definable things.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1128197-strange-places#post1128197\" target=\"_blank\">Strange Places</a> - A collection of Dark, Mysterious, and Wondrous Locations<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993181-twilight-menagerie\" target=\"_blank\">Twilight Menagerie</a> - A collection of Ephemeral Entities","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/775-reighnhell","name":"Reighnhell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar775_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"749"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T17:01:56-07:00","id":946551,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Reighnhell</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=946538#post946538\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Watching <b>Stranger Things</b> has me on an 80's kick, so an 80's Innocents Era wold be a great interest. I would also love any World War I or World War II material for any of the splats.</div> </div> </div> </div>The seed of the &quot;Faceless&quot; in Promethean 2nd Edition definitely lends itself to a WWI era. I'd love to see that crossover with Werewolf as they deal with unprecedented chaos in the spirit world spilling over the Gauntlet from fully industrialized warfare.<br /> <br /> On the other hand, while it cuts close to Wraith the Great War having already done the era with the closest equivalent WoD splat, Geist would fit the era powerfully, with the possibility of Geists/Cthonins/Kereboi who may be the five horsemen the themselves on the loose (the White Horseman riding the winds of influenza, the Red Horseman in the trenches of France, the Black Horseman lurking in Russia, the Grey Horseman hanging out in Detroit for unknown reasons*, and the Pale Horseman a complete mystery).<br /> <br /> * the mass production of the automobile will be his influenza/industrialized warfare/great famine","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T17:03:20-07:00","id":946552,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=946530#post946530\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Reminder that French Revolution was Mage/Mummy. God do I want to see that!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Well the old pitch was, no guarantee it will be for the new book. Strong argument they may want to get Beast in there for the &quot;Terror&quot; and the usurpation of Apexes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T17:38:35-07:00","id":946574,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Acrozatarim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=946444#post946444\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A question, since I've seen it pop up a few times and I am curious - what is it about the notion of Meiji Restoration Werewolf that people find inspiring or intriguing as a potential Dark Eras setting?</div> </div> </div> </div>LET ME GET HOME AND I'LL ANSWER THIS","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T18:54:19-07:00","id":946641,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Acrozatarim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=946444#post946444\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A question, since I've seen it pop up a few times and I am curious - what is it about the notion of Meiji Restoration Werewolf that people find inspiring or intriguing as a potential Dark Eras setting?</div> </div> </div> </div>Sorry about the wait!<br /> <br /> For me the Meiji period is an easy metaphor for Father Wolf's death at his childrens' hands; the influx of new technologies and the radical societal shift of the period are bloody and awful, but arguably necessary for Japan to survive as a modern nation (just as Father Wolf was too old to continue the hunt). Moving past that, a Hisil full of traditional kami and new spirits of gunpowder and steam, and your pack gets to be the glorious last gasp of the samurai Kurosawa-style are both pretty huge draws.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":12}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-09T04:22:54-07:00","id":946854,"title":"","content":"Lots of great ideas, here are mine.<br /> <br /> Changeling during the Sundering Era, drawing upon the Lost Pantheon Eldrich Entitlement and its origins for inspiration.<br /> <br /> Vampire during the Ghanaian Empire.<br /> <br /> Changeling during the Chandela Dynasty in India.<br /> <br /> Giest Ottomen Empire.<br /> <br /> Mummy during the Cruasades<br /> <br /> Inferno during the Caanite Era<br /> <br /> Arabian Werewolf<br /> <br /> Mage/Hunter Haitian Revolution<br /> <br /> Hunter/Demon Reformation<br /> <br /> Mage/Changeling Egypt, early New Kingdom<br /> <br /> Ayssrian Empire Werewolf<br /> <br /> Victorian Mummy<br /> <br /> French Revolution Immortals<br /> <br /> WWII Deviants (Captian America)<br /> <br /> Fall of the Aztec/Inca Empires during the coming of the conquisidors Giest.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-09T19:31:26-07:00","id":947424,"title":"","content":"I'd like 3900 BC in the Nile Valley. The end of the Holocene Wet Period with the Sahara returning to desert (quite rapidly in some models) after thousands of years of being savanna and humanity moving from hunter-gatherer tribes towards forming the society of Ancient Egypt. I was thinking maybe Vampire, to explore their rise in power as humanity begins to congregate into settlements, changing the way they hunt. Maybe a parallel to the human change. Vampire used to hunt like humans, tracking small tribes and preying on their weak members. Now, with settlements, they start to cultivate humans, becoming more subtle and manipulative. Another angle is Werewolf, dealing with new urban spirits and the loss of the hunt as an important cornerstone to human society. Not sure when the Sundering is supposed to occur, but perhaps this is post-Sundering and many werewolf are blaming the desertification on it. Really drive home the world in transition.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Eric Christian Berg</b><br /> <i>Onyx Path Freelancer</i><br /> Promethean: The Created Second Edition, Dark Eras Companion","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2019-eberg","name":"eberg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2019_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"284"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-09T20:35:14-07:00","id":947454,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>eberg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=947424#post947424\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd like 3900 BC in the Nile Valley. The end of the Holocene Wet Period with the Sahara returning to desert (quite rapidly in some models) after thousands of years of being savanna and humanity moving from hunter-gatherer tribes towards forming the society of Ancient Egypt. I was thinking maybe Vampire, to explore their rise in power as humanity begins to congregate into settlements, changing the way they hunt. Maybe a parallel to the human change. Vampire used to hunt like humans, tracking small tribes and preying on their weak members. Now, with settlements, they start to cultivate humans, becoming more subtle and manipulative. Another angle is Werewolf, dealing with new urban spirits and the loss of the hunt as an important cornerstone to human society. Not sure when the Sundering is supposed to occur, but perhaps this is post-Sundering and many werewolf are blaming the desertification on it. Really drive home the world in transition.</div> </div> </div> </div>I beliebe that's when the Nameless Empire is still up and running, which would be very, very exciting stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-09T20:55:33-07:00","id":947463,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=947454#post947454\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I beliebe that's when the Nameless Empire is still up and running, which would be very, very exciting stuff.</div> </div> </div> </div>I haven't gotten around to reading Mummy yet. Poking around on the internet just now, though, someone already posited that this period matched the fall of Irem, so it would be a really cool period for Mummy.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/519516-the-nameless-empire-and-the-5-9-ky-event\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/519516-the-nameless-empire-and-the-5-9-ky-event\"> The Nameless Empire and the 5.9 ky Event - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/519516-the-nameless-empire-and-the-5-9-ky-event\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/519516-the-nameless-empire-and-the-5-9-ky-event </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Alright, so I've been working on a timeline of both real world history and the history of the World of Darkness, both out of interest, and because it results in </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Eric Christian Berg</b><br /> <i>Onyx Path Freelancer</i><br /> Promethean: The Created Second Edition, Dark Eras Companion","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2019-eberg","name":"eberg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2019_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"284"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-09T22:54:22-07:00","id":947542,"title":"","content":"I'm seconding Jakki's idea for Golden Age of Piracy Geist. Hell, I would do anything for Golden Age of Piracy anything (except Mage or Beast, of course).<br /> <br /> Something really far in the past would be fun, Neolithic Era was great. Or possibly even a future dark era. <br /> <br /> If we're going to go really wild, an alternate history dark era would be fucking awesome. I've already been working on an alternate &quot;alchemypunk&quot; Promethean setting based on classic science fiction with the retro-futuristic aesthetics of Janelle Monae and the Protomen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-09T23:06:19-07:00","id":947549,"title":"","content":"Here's an especially odd idea for a crossover setting: Prague at the court of Rudolf II, Holy Roman Emperor. The Thirty Years' War setting takes place very soon after his death, presumably, but our focus is on our friend Rudolf and his position as a patron of all things occult and weird. He maintained an extensive 'cabinet of curiosities' full of international curiosities and clockwork marvels, routinely called upon John Dee, and requested a horoscope from Nostradamus. Everyone in the supernatural world wants to influence the emperor of the Holy Roman Empire, and everyone in the supernatural world has an in if they can appear before him with wonders and secret knowledge to gift.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T14:04:28-07:00","id":948040,"title":"","content":"I would also love to see a crossover in Akhenaten Egypt, specially written by Wood. I think he was the one that dropped a lot of hints in a lot of sourcebooks, and clearly had a vision. If not a crossover game, probably a Hunter Game. I'm not sure Wood still writes for Onyx, though. :/","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/196-max-deltree","name":"Max Deltree","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar196_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T15:43:12-07:00","id":948132,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>eberg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=947463#post947463\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I haven't gotten around to reading Mummy yet. Poking around on the internet just now, though, someone already posited that this period matched the fall of Irem, so it would be a really cool period for Mummy.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/519516-the-nameless-empire-and-the-5-9-ky-event\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...e-5-9-ky-event</a></div> </div> </div> </div>No mummy was actually awake and active during the period immediately following the fall of Irem, so it's actually not all that interesting to place a Mummy Era in it. They don't wake up until roughly 1.5 thousand years after the fall.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Revlid wrote:<br /> Yes, hollowing out your humanity to become an utterly utilitarian asura is the exact suggestion I would expect from you, Aiden.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/168-aiden","name":"Aiden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T15:59:41-07:00","id":948151,"title":"","content":"Spoiler: all the Dark areas are 1950s New Zealand.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T11:17:05-07:00","id":948710,"title":"","content":"On a more serious note, has anyone thought about practical gameplay considerations for their pet eras? For example, a Golden Age of Piracy DE would probably need a page or a sidebar about running naval combat scenes. <br /> <br /> The &quot;pirate code&quot; would be excellent from a gameplay standpoint, because it means that allowing the PCs to hold positions of power doesn't risk unbalancing the game: pirate captains were democratically elected and could be overruled and impeached, and the political interactions aboard a pirate ship are a sadly neglected part of pirate media that would be a lot of fun to roleplay.<br /> <br /> Jakki's initial idea of having it be a Geist DE is still my favorite, but if you wanted it in another line, Vampire, Werewolf, and Changeling would be the others best suited to it. I wouldn't have it as a Mummy dark era, with the caveat that a Mummy pirate captain whose cult was a pirate crew would be completely awesome.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T12:43:07-07:00","id":948761,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=948710#post948710\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On a more serious note, has anyone thought about practical gameplay considerations for their pet eras? For example, a Golden Age of Piracy DE would probably need a page or a sidebar about running naval combat scenes.<br /> <br /> The &quot;pirate code&quot; would be excellent from a gameplay standpoint, because it means that allowing the PCs to hold positions of power doesn't risk unbalancing the game: pirate captains were democratically elected and could be overruled and impeached, and the political interactions aboard a pirate ship are a sadly neglected part of pirate media that would be a lot of fun to roleplay.<br /> <br /> Jakki's initial idea of having it be a Geist DE is still my favorite, but if you wanted it in another line, Vampire, Werewolf, and Changeling would be the others best suited to it. I wouldn't have it as a Mummy dark era, with the caveat that a Mummy pirate captain whose cult was a pirate crew would be completely awesome.</div> </div> </div> </div>Geist fits best because of a combination of factors; the obvious &quot;dead men tell no tales&quot; branding, the ease of crew as krewe, and the smashing together of mythologies (Catholic, West African, Central American, random superstitions) already fits with building your krewe mythos as well. If I had to toss another game in there, I'd probably go for Changeling, with the whole idea that some pirates are just as much runaways and escapees as the Lost themselves are, and the added bonus of getting to see what the Hedge is like on the open seas.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T12:59:31-07:00","id":948785,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=948710#post948710\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On a more serious note, has anyone thought about practical gameplay considerations for their pet eras? For example, a Golden Age of Piracy DE would probably need a page or a sidebar about running naval combat scenes.<br /> <br /> The &quot;pirate code&quot; would be excellent from a gameplay standpoint, because it means that allowing the PCs to hold positions of power doesn't risk unbalancing the game: pirate captains were democratically elected and could be overruled and impeached, and the political interactions aboard a pirate ship are a sadly neglected part of pirate media that would be a lot of fun to roleplay.</div> </div> </div> </div>Good points.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=948710#post948710\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Jakki's initial idea of having it be a Geist DE is still my favorite, but if you wanted it in another line, Vampire, Werewolf, and Changeling would be the others best suited to it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Vampire might be tricky (due to sunlight restrictions). Though a Gargoyle ship that could sink under the waves during the day would make a great ghost story.<br /> Werewolf would be about as awesome as Geist.<br /> Changeling is workable (but it usually is).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=948710#post948710\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wouldn't have it as a Mummy dark era, with the caveat that a Mummy pirate captain whose cult was a pirate crew would be completely awesome.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;The captain doesn't like to be woken up.&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T13:45:06-07:00","id":948823,"title":"","content":"Mummy would be interesting just because the Arisen would likely be so ill at ease, especially with the was they reacted to Iberia.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T13:51:29-07:00","id":948829,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Max Deltree</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=948040#post948040\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would also love to see a crossover in Akhenaten Egypt, specially written by Wood. I think he was the one that dropped a lot of hints in a lot of sourcebooks, and clearly had a vision. If not a crossover game, probably a Hunter Game. I'm not sure Wood still writes for Onyx, though. :/</div> </div> </div> </div>He's been writing fiction for Onyx Path. He wrote for <i>Tales of the Dark Eras</i>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/627-mr-innes","name":"Mr Innes","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T16:58:29-07:00","id":948941,"title":"","content":"Really really niche, but I've been thinking a lot about a &quot;Satanic Panic&quot; Beast period. Set in 80s and early 90s rural Americana and inspired by such scandals and modern day witch hunts as the Frankin Coverup, the McMartin Preschool case and the West Memphis 3. Maybe a 2nd edition update for Possessed as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11643-corax","name":"Corax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"80"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T17:21:50-07:00","id":948952,"title":"","content":"I want a Dark Era the synergizes with the Crossover Chronicle Book.<br /> <br /> And MOST of all I want them to want till all the settings are updated for 2e, mixing 1e and 2e lead to some unfortunate mechanics in DE1.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T00:25:31-07:00","id":949169,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=948952#post948952\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I want a Dark Era the synergizes with the Crossover Chronicle Book.<br /> <br /> And MOST of all I want them to want till all the settings are updated for 2e, mixing 1e and 2e lead to some unfortunate mechanics in DE1.</div> </div> </div> </div>. That's at leat two years, and probably more like four or five. Totally agree on crossover though.","signature":"<hr 