s,in think his name ,oh I don't know. something with a &quot;J&quot;<br /> Johnny? James? Oh wait. i think this sorta famous Slasher was named <i>Jack</i></div> </div> </div> </div><i>Psst, look above you!</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-10T22:38:28-07:00","id":967181,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=967179#post967179\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <i>Psst, look above you!</i></div> </div> </div> </div>Oh,I see you've already mentioned him,my mistake then.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-10T23:09:54-07:00","id":967195,"title":"","content":"Slasher has lots of potential eras, other than the aforementioned Whitechapel <br /> <br /> Heck, as Slasher pointed out, there were times in human history in which someone who killed everyone in their way got thrown parades if not given crowns. Biblical eras, Mythic Greece, Ireland, or Northern Europe. Heck I imagine there are more mythic eras steeped in blood than not. <br /> <br /> Or the Great White North, perhaps (some) Wendigo were a Slasher phenomenon. Perhaps a proto-conspiracy of slashers?<br /> <br /> Or perhaps Slasher the Satanic Conspiracy Mass Hysteria era? Perhaps there were great slasher but not (necessarily) satanic conspiracies out there?<br /> <br /> As for war eras, how about Slasher WW1? Slasher the crusades? <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-11T00:52:56-07:00","id":967228,"title":"","content":"Inferno desperately needs one as well. Can anyone top the Albigensian Crusade?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-11T01:04:55-07:00","id":967230,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=966542#post966542\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Three words: Kowloon Walled City. I'd probably make it Vampire.</div> </div> </div> </div>Make it Vampire/Werewolf. I really want to see how Werewolves divide up territory and what the Shadow looks like in such a cramped and unique place.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/477-xenorath","name":"Xenorath","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar477_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"169"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-11T08:25:16-07:00","id":967324,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=967228#post967228\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Inferno desperately needs one as well. Can anyone top the Albigensian Crusade?</div> </div> </div> </div>How about the time of Crowley :^)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-11T08:52:13-07:00","id":967341,"title":"","content":"As for a Slasher focused Era, I'll say the Spanish Inquisition - it is already being presented as &quot;mini Era&quot; in the book itself, after all, and it has great potential IMO.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-11T11:06:27-07:00","id":967411,"title":"","content":"Now that we're on minor templates, what would be another good Skinchangers era?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-11T16:00:14-07:00","id":967580,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StSword</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=967195#post967195\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Slasher has lots of potential eras, other than the aforementioned Whitechapel<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Or perhaps Slasher the Satanic Conspiracy Mass Hysteria era? Perhaps there were great slasher but not (necessarily) satanic conspiracies out there?<br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>We do need more 80s eras, and it was the golden age of classic slasher movies. So I figure that since vampire got the 80s first, the next 80s eras should be hunter/slasher, then beast and changling (lot of fairy tale movies in the 80s) then werewolf (not just because of teen wolf but also all the other classic werewolf movies of the 80s),","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-11T18:00:51-07:00","id":967634,"title":"","content":"It's a bit close to the Neolithic setting in Dark Eras I, but maybe Werewolf during the first cities (Uruk, Ur, Lagash). How the hunt adapted to the denser city environment, the emergence of urban spirits requiring new thinking from the wolves and the increasing contradiction between the need to hunt and your human life.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3326-an-fhuiseog","name":"An Fhuiseog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3326_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"271"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-11T18:09:45-07:00","id":967640,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>An Fhuiseog</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=967634#post967634\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's a bit close to the Neolithic setting in Dark Eras I, but maybe Werewolf during the first cities (Uruk, Ur, Lagash). How the hunt adapted to the denser city environment, the emergence of urban spirits requiring new thinking from the wolves and the increasing contradiction between the need to hunt and your human life.</div> </div> </div> </div>So, a sort of sequel to it? That could be cool. I'd also be happy with Neolithic for everyone, or more really early Dark Eras, maybe even pre-Neolithic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-11T18:32:37-07:00","id":967653,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>An Fhuiseog</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=967634#post967634\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's a bit close to the Neolithic setting in Dark Eras I, but maybe Werewolf during the first cities (Uruk, Ur, Lagash). How the hunt adapted to the denser city environment, the emergence of urban spirits requiring new thinking from the wolves and the increasing contradiction between the need to hunt and your human life.</div> </div> </div> </div>After the Sundering werewolves were maddened by their lack of a home. There were no tribes yet. It would be very chaotic. So that's a plus.<br /> <br /> But urban spirits and the existence of urban areas wouldn't be much of a difference in play. Werewolves are born in cities or countries just like everyone else. And just like people, some would always eschew more populated areas, and others would always be drawn to them. In Pangaea the latter were called Shepherds or Tyrants.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 09-11-2016, 09:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-11T18:38:48-07:00","id":967654,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=967136#post967136\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What would be a good historical setting to have Slasher content in?</div> </div> </div> </div>Obviously the 80's have been mentioned. I would also suggest the late 40's, just after WWII. Europe (particularly France and Germany) was going through an epidemic of vigilante murders whose true numbers are still considered very under reported. Mostly the targets were fascists, communists, collaborators, and informants, but the chaos of of post-war Europe, the corrosion of societal ties caused by the war, and the fragile state of law and order afforded ample opportunity for other victims as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-11T18:40:04-07:00","id":967656,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>An Fhuiseog</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=967634#post967634\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's a bit close to the Neolithic setting in Dark Eras I, but maybe Werewolf during the first cities (Uruk, Ur, Lagash). How the hunt adapted to the denser city environment, the emergence of urban spirits requiring new thinking from the wolves and the increasing contradiction between the need to hunt and your human life.</div> </div> </div> </div>You mean like the Sumerian setting it got back in 1e?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-11T18:42:25-07:00","id":967657,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=967656#post967656\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You mean like the Sumerian setting it got back in 1e?</div> </div> </div> </div>Didn't know about that, case closed I guess!<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3326-an-fhuiseog","name":"An Fhuiseog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3326_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"271"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-11T19:07:51-07:00","id":967667,"title":"","content":"It wasn't so much a setting as much as the skeleton for a small story arc. In modern times you come across bricks of a ziggurat that give you dreams that may be visions of a past that is very loosely described. Almost the entire section is made useless by the changes from the jump to second edition.<br /> <br /> Some people seem to really like it, though I'm surprised considering its content. It might be worth revising for the new edition, though it would be weird justifying the god-king angle. It worked when they were 'spirit police,' basically superheroes. Now they're predators par excellence, and having a populace willing to serve under them knowing this, and that they might be the next prey, would be weird.<br /> <br /> Unless they were a huge lodge.<br /> <br /> It occurs to me that many of my posts have been for the most part negative about proposals than adding more of my own. I am a little tired of it, we have had these threads before and more than a few of these ideas have been repeated several times over, but there are some new ones so here's some of mine.<br /> <br /> For Slasher, India in the 1830s during the suppression of the thugs, or during the time of Nimrod which was called up in the Slasher book. For vampire, the California Gold Rush, the rise of Communism in China, Morocco during World War 2, or the Roman conquest of Britain or during the Khedivate of Egypt after the French invasion of said country. Also obviously at whatever point the Pijavica began to spread. For werewolf, still Vietnam during the war, South or Central America during the colonization, as Spain enslaved but immersed with the populace, turned them from their religion, all for so much silver to ship home, Macedonia a bit past 1900. Something that would require a drastic adaptation would be the advent and proliferation of the gun, and consequently the effectiveness of silver bullets. Before you could theoretically use silver arrows but more realistically it could come down to silver knives and swords and, thus, death. So the rise of the gun would be interesting to play around with.<br /> <br /> I'd really like to tackle the Crusades for everybody, but that seems very much a Classic World of Darkness setting. Overall I'd like to see more Asia, outside of Japan, and Africa. And I would really like breaks from the standard 'biomes.' More deserts and jungles. Something in Egypt after the French","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 09-11-2016, 11:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-12T01:20:00-07:00","id":967828,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=967228#post967228\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Inferno desperately needs one as well. Can anyone top the Albigensian Crusade?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I've given that some thought.<br /> <br /> Inferno- Las Vegas, or Inferno Hollywood seem a little on the nose to me though, considering stereotypes.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-12T04:57:37-07:00","id":967864,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=967228#post967228\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Inferno desperately needs one as well. Can anyone top the Albigensian Crusade?</div> </div> </div> </div>I once played in a heavily-religious Vampire campaign set during this period. It has immense potential. I found the gnostic themes worked really well with Vampire, but then I was mad for Ashen Cults.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Eric Christian Berg</b><br /> <i>Onyx Path Freelancer</i><br /> Promethean: The Created Second Edition, Dark Eras Companion","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2019-eberg","name":"eberg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2019_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"284"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-12T06:34:23-07:00","id":967892,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=967228#post967228\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Inferno desperately needs one as well. Can anyone top the Albigensian Crusade?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd really rather Inferno taking place during the Italian unification","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Useless-Post Prana<br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Cost: 2</span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">m; </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mins: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Linguistics 1, Essence 1 </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Type: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Simple</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Keywords: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mute</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Duration: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Instant</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Prerequisite Charms: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Ten-Characters Methodology</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2589-magnum-opus","name":"Magnum Opus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2589_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"821"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-12T11:44:58-07:00","id":968051,"title":"","content":"I second a Werewolf game during the Vietnam War (I tried to launch a WtA Werewolf Vietnam game ages ago, and I think Forsaken is just as thematically appropriate). I think there's a lot of fodder there both in terms of the actual war front and the anarchist and free love movements stateside.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8492-dxanders","name":"dxanders","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"378"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-13T08:12:44-07:00","id":968525,"title":"","content":"If Dark Ages is essentially going to be a recurring series (and it seems like it will), I'd love to see a series of books that all cover a series of history, with each &quot;era&quot; piggybacking off the other. This would give players and STs all the tools to play an expansive long-form game and also play with the cause-and-effect of major historical events while having thematic currents flow from one setting to the next.<br /> <br /> Someone mentioned a line-wide vision of the WoD after the fall of the Mongols, with each line focusing on a different region, and I think that's a genius idea.<br /> <br /> I'd like to see a book that, for instance, starts with the Age of Imperialism and sees those plot threads extend through the end of WWII. Off the top of my head, it might look something like this:<br /> <br /> Geist in the Belgian Congo<br /> Vampire in newly unified Germany<br /> Werewolf in the dying days of the Wild West<br /> Russian Revolution Demon<br /> Beast in the trenches and countryside of WWI Europe<br /> Mage during the Age of Spiritualism (with Edison and Tesla for added cache)<br /> Changeling in the Golden Age of Cinema<br /> Promethean Munich: 1937 - 1939<br /> Something something during the French Resistance (thoughts?)<br /> Innocents Blitz<br /> Hunter Pacific Theater<br /> Deviant Last Days of WWII (superhuman arms race)<br /> a crossover setting for Berlin just after the war, similar to what was depicted in The Third Man, with the city split up into districts controlled by the various Allies and the government in complete disarray.<br /> <br /> It would perfectly set things up for Dark Ages: Cold War, which I'd also love to see, and I think Demon: Moscow taking place shortly after the collapse of the USSR would be a fantastic capstone to that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8492,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8492-dxanders","user":"dxanders","date":". 09-13-2016, 11:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8492-dxanders","name":"dxanders","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"378"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-13T10:21:14-07:00","id":968594,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>dxanders</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=968525#post968525\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Deviant Last Days of WWII (superhuman arms race)</div> </div> </div> </div>Oddly, I was just coming over to suggest this. It's tender territory to tread, though, since it would inevitably touch on medical experimentation by German and Japanese scientists. Tricky to manage tastefully, IMO.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Eric Christian Berg</b><br /> <i>Onyx Path Freelancer</i><br /> Promethean: The Created Second Edition, Dark Eras Companion","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2019-eberg","name":"eberg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2019_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"284"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-13T10:24:08-07:00","id":968599,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>eberg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=968594#post968594\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oddly, I was just coming over to suggest this. It's tender territory to tread, though, since it would inevitably touch on medical experimentation by German and Japanese scientists. Tricky to manage tastefully, IMO.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah. You'd have to toe a very VERY careful line with it, and I haven't really kept up with Deviant's development, so I'm not entirely sure what form the core book takes.<br /> <br /> If you did a Cold War book, you could further build on the idea with Soviet and American experiments.<br /> <br /> Leopold's Congo and Munich around the time of Kristallnacht would require a very delicate touch too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8492-dxanders","name":"dxanders","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"378"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-13T10:31:39-07:00","id":968604,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>dxanders</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=968599#post968599\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you did a Cold War book, you could further build on the idea with Soviet and American experiments.</div> </div> </div> </div>Two words: Operation Paperclip.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Eric Christian Berg</b><br /> <i>Onyx Path Freelancer</i><br /> Promethean: The Created Second Edition, Dark Eras Companion","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2019-eberg","name":"eberg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2019_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"284"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-13T10:34:50-07:00","id":968608,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>eberg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=968604#post968604\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Two words: Operation Paperclip.</div> </div> </div> </div> Don't forget Iron Comrade!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-13T19:11:42-07:00","id":968919,"title":"","content":"I mostly just want the &quot;Golden age of Piracy&quot; that didn't make it into Dark Eras 1, though I think it would be a good Beast setting (maybe Geist/Beast).<br /> <br /> I'd also like to see a &quot;God Machine&quot; setting, It wouldn't be a Demon setting just the super weird stuff like the Chronicles Anthology and GMC went into. Maybe it would detail angels, infrastructure, and linchpins. Bonus points if it revolves around the church or some other Abrahamic beliefs.<br /> <br /> WWI Promethean<br /> <br /> Also Africa, I'm not sure which splat though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":4046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","user":"xenoterracide","date":". 09-13-2016, 10:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-13T20:09:30-07:00","id":968953,"title":"","content":"Perhaps War of the Roses, England (changeling/demon?). 100 years war.<br /> <br /> (I'm aware these aren't actual periods... but I think they sum up what I'm looking for)<br /> <br /> Ivanhoe/Robin Hood crusades era would always be interesting. <br /> <br /> Mage/Changeling/Werewolf Druidic era England.<br /> <br /> Beast, Pre (or early colonial) Native American