dea, or the Hunters who span the Empire...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-13T20:55:30-07:00","id":968978,"title":"","content":"A big huge crossover setting for one era would be amazing. It'd be another big project OP could do. I'd make it Golden Age of Piracy, but I accept that that's just because I'm obsessed with pirates. <br /> <br /> And a blue book/GMC Dark Era could be fun. I mentioned an &quot;birth of the Internet&quot; DE for Demon, but it'd be cool if it had mortals support.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-13T21:11:06-07:00","id":968986,"title":"","content":"I really like birth of the internet Demon, but either it's too recent for me to justify it as an Era or I think it'd be better served as a Mirrors cyberpunk hack","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-13T21:20:00-07:00","id":968994,"title":"","content":"Honestly, the 90s and 2000s were a lot weirder than a lot of people remember. But maybe they'd save it for Dark Eras 4 or 5.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-13T21:30:00-07:00","id":968999,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=968994#post968994\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Honestly, the 90s and 2000s were a lot weirder than a lot of people remember. But maybe they'd save it for Dark Eras 4 or 5.</div> </div> </div> </div>If it gives me early Network Zero circulating VHS tapes of monsters, I'll take it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-15T17:59:56-07:00","id":970353,"title":"","content":"Lot's of people who were alive in the 90s + are still alive, tOPP would have to handle such era's with extra care (their words paraphrased).<br /> <br /> TBH. I have very little interest in any era's post 1900s, they're too recent for me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-15T18:47:15-07:00","id":970380,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xenoterracide</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=970353#post970353\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Lot's of people who were alive in the 90s + are still alive, tOPP would have to handle such era's with extra care (their words paraphrased).<br /> <br /> TBH. I have very little interest in any era's post 1900s, they're too recent for me.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Jazz Age is too recent for you? The Great War? These are three and four and five generations back from the modern audience; I know people who lost great-grandparents to WW2.<br /> <br /> I get not wanting the 1990s and 2000s, sure, but if you take a second and look at the gulf of difference between a world that has an internet and a War on Terror and a world that doesn't. This gets especially obvious when you dig into genres (espionage between today and even a decade ago is huge, and three decades may as well be another planet) or places (Chicago going from a mafia town to a place with blacksite police prisons, China as a nation going from a barely industrial Communist state to a world economic superpower, Romania's shift from a Communist dictatorship to a democratic - if impoverished - nation, etc etc etc).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-15T19:04:05-07:00","id":970391,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=968994#post968994\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Honestly, the 90s and 2000s were a lot weirder than a lot of people remember. But maybe they'd save it for Dark Eras 4 or 5.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You might be interested in reading Thomas Pynchon's Bleeding Edge. It's far from his best novel, but it's a hell of a lot more accessible than something like Gravity's Rainbow. He tends to dig into the pop culture ephemera to create a distinct sense of space and time, and BE is all about the weird cultural shift of the late 90s and early 2000s.<br /> <br /> I do think it's an interesting era, but I think it's too recent for us to really have perspective on. I'd give it a decade or so before we can really reflect back and zone in on what made it special. Besides which, most players lived through it and don't really need a guidebook. In other words, it's an interesting and important period of time, but I think page count would be better suited on focusing on eras that are more alien and distinct from the present.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8492-dxanders","name":"dxanders","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"378"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-15T19:47:03-07:00","id":970420,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=970380#post970380\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The Jazz Age is too recent for you? The Great War? These are three and four and five generations back from the modern audience; I know people who lost great-grandparents to WW2.<br /> <br /> I get not wanting the 1990s and 2000s, sure, but if you take a second and look at the gulf of difference between a world that has an internet and a War on Terror and a world that doesn't. This gets especially obvious when you dig into genres (espionage between today and even a decade ago is huge, and three decades may as well be another planet) or places (Chicago going from a mafia town to a place with blacksite police prisons, China as a nation going from a barely industrial Communist state to a world economic superpower, Romania's shift from a Communist dictatorship to a democratic - if impoverished - nation, etc etc etc).</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'm not saying that there aren't differences, it's just a lot easier to build a chronicle on something ~100 years ago than it is 1000 years ago. Also I've always been more interested in ancient history than modern history. Also I see tOPP writers saying they have to tread carefully about a war that was almost 100 years ago. So how're they supposed to write about 10 years ago? (and to some extent, Chrod 1.0 was written in a 10 years ago setting). Oh and my parents caught the tail end of the great depression.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-15T19:51:54-07:00","id":970424,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xenoterracide</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/945788-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=970420#post970420\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I'm not saying that there aren't differences, it's just a lot easier to build a chronicle on something ~100 years ago than it is 1000 years ago. Also I've always been more interested in ancient history than modern history. Also I see tOPP writers saying they have to tread carefully about a war that was almost 100 years ago. So how're they supposed to write about 10 years ago? (and to some extent, Chrod 1.0 was written in a 10 years ago setting). Oh and my parents caught the tail end of the great depression.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it's silly to write off more recent history when it's just as full of inspiration, is all. The Roman Republic was just as much full of real people as the Vietnam War was, and so long as you treat both with equal respect you're fairly well set. Onyx Path seems to be pretty well past the 'Himmler was a vampire' shitshows of the ancient White Wolf days and I'd trust any competent writer to handle history well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"att